      "id": "gear_report_armorer_used",
      "request": "gear_report",
      "lines": [
        "It took the moment cleanly. Good gear is quiet until the blow lands.",
        "It did the job when fear was loud. That's praise enough.",
        "Good gear earns trust the moment trouble tests it.",
        "Let me see that. The straps and plates tell a story if you know where to look.",
        "That has seen use. Not enough to panic, but enough to respect it.",
        "A small flaw becomes a loud problem when trouble starts moving.",
        "Keep your shield ready. Most people notice damage after it matters.",
        "This is still serviceable, but do not treat that as permission to be reckless.",
        "I would fix that before night. Night has a talent for finding weak spots.",
        "Good equipment should feel boring. Exciting equipment is usually breaking.",
        "The straps held under strain.",
        "The fit stayed true.",
        "The plate spread the force.",
        "That scrape proves its work.",
        "Nothing shifted at impact.",
        "The metal protected bone.",
        "I trust this piece now.",
        "Mud reached it, not failure.",
        "Every dent was earned.",
        "Good work came home marked."
      ],
      "conditions": [
